  "name": "humanbody",
  "description": "A mechanistic multilevel simulation of human physiology designed to model integrated systems including sleep, digestion, muscle flexion, and immune responses. The project aims to simulate pathological states and disease progression, such as the common cold and IBS, through high-fidelity biological modeling. It evaluates the implementation of these complex biological systems in Julia to achieve high-performance multiscale simulation.",
